{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"群的内自同构"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"内自同构"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$, 其<strong>内自同构</strong>是指由共轭\n$$\r\ng\\mapsto hgh^{-1}\r\n$$\n给出的自同构.</p>\n<p>注意, 对于生象群 $G$ 上面的描述不能按字面意思理解; 内自同构的生象<strong>不是</strong> $G$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":" $G\\to\\operatorname{Aut}(G)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"像","text":"像"}},{"Plain":", 而是 $G/Z(G)$.</p>\n<p>todo</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"群的外自同构","text":"群的外自同构"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}